ery minute'),(9978,2,279,156470,'i stood like a man paralyzed still staring at the ground which i had traversed'),(9979,2,1502,67,'then suddenly i saw it'),(9980,2,74,156470,'there was movement among the bushes at the far end of the clearing which i had just traversed'),(9981,2,23,174321,'a great dark shadow disengaged itself and hopped out into the clear moonlight'),(9982,2,279,67,'i say hopped advisedly for the beast moved like a kangaroo springing along in an erect position upon its powerful hind legs while its front ones were held bent in front of it'),(9983,2,67,143851,'it was of enormous size and power like an erect elephant but its movements in spite of its bulk were exceedingly alert'),(9984,2,284,7445,'for a moment as i saw its shape i hoped that it was an iguanodon which i knew to be harmless but ignorant as i was i soon saw that this was a very different creature'),(9985,2,6884,77102,'instead of the gentle deer-shaped head of the great three-toed leaf-eater this beast had a broad squat toad-like face like that which had alarmed us in our camp'),(9986,2,892,116822,'his ferocious cry and the horrible energy of his pursuit both assured me that this was surely one of the great flesh-eating dinosaurs the most terrible beasts which have ever walked this earth'),(9987,2,42,1051,'as the huge brute loped along it dropped forward upon its fore-paws and brought its nose to the ground every twenty yards or so'),(9988,2,67,146810,'it was smelling out my trail'),(9989,2,841,8377,'sometimes for an instant it was at fault'),(9990,2,1502,255,'then it would catch it up again and come bounding swiftly along the path i had taken'),(9991,2,1232,90669,'even now when i think of that nightmare the sweat breaks out upon my brow'),(9992,2,994,513,'what could i do'),(9993,2,413,410,'my useless fowling-piece was in my hand'),(9994,2,994,163,'what help could i get from that'),(9995,2,279,176608,'i looked desperately round for some rock or tree but i was in a bushy jungle with nothing