2,655,727,'no doubt my absence had been noticed'),(10062,2,1056,8866,'they had imagined that i was lost in the woods and had fired this shot to guide me home'),(10063,2,67,42292,'it is true that we had made a strict resolution against firing but if it seemed to them that i might be in danger they would not hesitate'),(10064,2,67,112,'it was for me now to hurry on as fast as possible and so to reassure them'),(10065,2,279,1980,'i was weary and spent so my progress was not so fast as i wished but at last i came into regions which i knew'),(10066,2,74,165480,'there was the swamp of the pterodactyls upon my left there in front of me was the glade of the iguanodons'),(10067,2,2530,128876,'now i was in the last belt of trees which separated me from fort challenger'),(10068,2,279,1912,'i raised my voice in a cheery shout to allay their fears'),(10069,2,655,424,'no answering greeting came back to me'),(10070,2,413,177713,'my heart sank at that ominous stillness'),(10071,2,279,17034,'i quickened my pace into a run'),(10072,2,51,2679,'the zareba rose before me even as i had left it but the gate was open'),(10073,2,279,50,'i rushed in'),(10074,2,50,917,'in the cold morning light it was a fearful sight which met my eyes'),(10075,2,2043,163195,'our effects were scattered in wild confusion over the ground my comrades had disappeared and close to the smouldering ashes of our fire the grass was stained crimson with a hideous pool of blood'),(10076,2,279,4165,'i was so stunned by this sudden shock that for a time i must have nearly lost my reason'),(10077,2,279,47604,'i have a vague recollection as one remembers a bad dream of rushing about through the woods all round the empty camp calling wildly for my companions'),(10078,2,655,148486,'no answer came back from the silent shadows'),(10079,2,51,21138,'the horrible thought that i might never see them again that i might find myself abandoned all alone in that dreadful place with no possible way of descending into the world below that 