 explains it'),(14219,3,279,248231,'i can trust dick'),(14220,3,2074,949,'you could put a whole regiment of dicks on my back without making me feel any better'),(14221,3,279,67,'i know just enough to be uncomfortable and not enough to go on in spite of it'),(14222,3,1649,202899,'we do not understand said the bullocks'),(14223,3,279,5853,'i know you dont'),(14224,3,4348,2074,'im not talking to you'),(14225,3,2074,75,'you dont know what blood is'),(14226,3,1649,202899,'we do said the bullocks'),(14227,3,67,250254,'it is red stuff that soaks into the ground and smells'),(14228,3,51,171324,'the troop-horse gave a kick and a bound and a snort'),(14229,3,5853,2257,'dont talk of it he said'),(14230,3,279,67,'i can smell it now just thinking of it'),(14231,3,67,1886,'it makes me want to run--when i havent dick on my back'),(14232,3,295,202899,'but it is not here said the camel and the bullocks'),(14233,3,4949,7315,'why are you so stupid'),(14234,3,153,247646,'its vile stuff said billy'),(14235,3,279,67,'i dont want to run but i dont want to talk about it'),(14236,3,74,60,'there you are'),(14237,3,2257,3901,'said two tails waving his tail to explain'),(14238,3,9487,202899,'yes we have been here all night said the bullocks'),(14239,3,1024,247872,'two tails stamped his foot till the iron ring on it jingled'),(14240,3,5037,2074,'oh im not talking to you'),(14241,3,2074,84985,'you cant see inside your heads'),(14242,3,1649,202899,'we see out of our four eyes said the bullocks'),(14243,3,1649,2793,'we see straight in front of us'),(14244,3,257,172,'if i could do that and nothing else you wouldnt be needed to pull the big guns at all'),(14245,3,257,159396,'if i was like my captain--he can see things inside his head before the firing begins and he shakes all over but he knows too much to run away--if i was like him i could pull the guns'),(14246,3,295,454,'but if i were as wise as all that i should never be here'),(14247,3,279,706,'i should be a king in the forest as i used to be sleeping half the day and bathing when i liked'),(14248,3,279,19004,'i havent had a good bath for a month'),(14249,3,228305,247646,'thats all very fine said billy'),(14250,3,295,949,'but giving a thing a long name doesnt make it any better'),(14251,3,2257,4355,'said the troop horse'),(14252,3,279,920,'i think i understand what two tails means'),(14253,3,104155,33870,'youll understand better in a minute said two tails angrily'),(14254,3,2530,37,'now you just explain to me why you dont like this'),(14255,3,258,245283,'he began trumpeting furiously at the top of his trumpet'),(14256,3,37491,163,'stop that'),(14257,3,2257,250568,'said billy and the troop horse together and i could hear them stamp and shiver'),(14258,3,573,9700,'an elephants trumpeting is always nasty especially on a dark night'),(14259,3,279,164978,'i shant stop said two tails'),(14260,3,122422,8565,'wont you explain that please'),(14261,3,1502,4196,'then he stopped suddenly and i heard a little whimper in the dark and knew that vixen had found me at last'),(14262,3,729,150555,'she knew as well as i did that if there is one thing in the world the elephant is more afraid of than another it is a little barking dog'),(14263,3,1051,42747,'so she stopped to bully two tails in his pickets and yapped round his big feet'),(14264,3,1024,244990,'two tails shuffled and squeaked'),(14265,3,351,150555,'go away little dog'),(14266,3,258,2257,'he said'),(14267,3,5853,2074,'dont snuff at my ankles or ill kick at you'),(14268,3,676,1502,'good little dog--nice little doggie then'),(14269,3,351,132311,'go home you yelping little beast'),(14270,3,5037,4025,'oh why doesnt someone take her away'),(14271,3,1867,26616,'shell bite me in a minute'),(14272,3,422,314,'seems to me said billy to the troop horse that our friend two tails is afraid of most things'),(14273,3,2530,1486,'now if i had a full meal for every dog ive kicked across the parade-ground i should be as fat as two tails nearly'),(14274,3,279,77102,'i whistled and vi