 orders'),(14298,3,2530,208932,'now you want to know too much young un said billy and that is one way of getting kicked'),(14299,3,172,6503,'all you have to do is to obey the man at your head and ask no questions'),(14300,3,228518,164978,'hes quite right said two tails'),(14301,3,279,28,'i cant always obey because im betwixt and between'),(14302,3,295,106,'but billys right'),(14303,3,116984,251122,'obey the man next to you who gives the order or youll stop all the battery besides getting a thrashing'),(14304,3,51,351,'the gun-bullocks got up to go'),(14305,3,6169,2257,'morning is coming they said'),(14306,3,1649,4118,'we will go back to our lines'),(14307,3,67,3225,'it is true that we only see out of our eyes and we are not very clever'),(14308,3,295,6416,'but still we are the only people to-night who have not been afraid'),(14309,3,159518,7105,'good-night you brave people'),(14310,3,7899,150555,'nobody answered and the troop-horse said to change the conversation wheres that little dog'),(14311,3,23,482,'a dog means a man somewhere about'),(14312,3,454,1278,'here i am yapped vixen under the gun tail with my man'),(14313,3,2074,77134,'you big blundering beast of a camel you you upset our tent'),(14314,3,413,7118,'my mans very angry'),(14315,3,2257,202899,'said the bullocks'),(14316,3,258,1894,'he must be white'),(14317,3,53,246824,'of course he is said vixen'),(14318,3,513,251246,'do you suppose im looked after by a black bullock-driver'),(14319,3,2257,202899,'said the bullocks'),(14320,3,2792,16572,'let us get away quickly'),(14321,3,1056,251277,'they plunged forward in the mud and managed somehow to run their yoke on the pole of an ammunition wagon where it jammed'),(14322,3,2530,43962,'now you have done it said billy calmly'),(14323,3,5853,69328,'dont struggle'),(14324,3,218673,171645,'youre hung up till daylight'),(14325,3,994,6358,'what on earths the matter'),(14326,3,51,203156,'the bullocks went off into the long hissing snorts that indian cattle give and pushe