 that'),(20965,5,729,336170,'she ejaculated'),(20966,5,4187,10170,'where is the boy'),(20967,5,74,69585,'there wasnt any boy said matthew wretchedly'),(20968,5,74,382,'there was only her'),(20969,5,258,5031,'he nodded at the child remembering that he had never even asked her name'),(20970,5,655,10170,'no boy'),(20971,5,295,333265,'but there must have been a boy insisted marilla'),(20972,5,1649,273,'we sent word to mrs'),(20973,5,335273,10170,'spencer to bring a boy'),(20974,5,43,228326,'well she didnt'),(20975,5,729,382,'she brought her'),(20976,5,279,336712,'i asked the stationmaster'),(20977,5,1,8866,'and i had to bring her home'),(20978,5,729,50,'she couldnt be left there no matter where the mistake had come in'),(20979,5,43,661,'well this is a pretty piece of business'),(20980,5,336170,333265,'ejaculated marilla'),(20981,5,3852,11135,'during this dialogue the child had remained silent her eyes roving from one to the other all the animation fading out of her face'),(20982,5,5725,2257,'suddenly she seemed to grasp the full meaning of what had been said'),(20983,5,149724,22498,'dropping her precious carpet-bag she sprang forward a step and clasped her hands'),(20984,5,2074,424,'you dont want me'),(20985,5,729,4916,'she cried'),(20986,5,2074,10170,'you dont want me because im not a boy'),(20987,5,279,67,'i might have expected it'),(20988,5,7899,424,'nobody ever did want me'),(20989,5,279,4196,'i might have known it was all too beautiful to last'),(20990,5,279,424,'i might have known nobody really did want me'),(20991,5,5037,513,'oh what shall i do'),(20992,5,4348,62883,'im going to burst into tears'),(20993,5,43375,991,'burst into tears she did'),(20994,5,7456,341517,'sitting down on a chair by the table flinging her arms out upon it and burying her face in them she proceeded to cry stormily'),(20995,5,333265,341528,'marilla and matthew looked at each other deprecatingly across the stove'),(20996,5,3483,513,'neither of them knew what to say or do'),(20997,5,27627,23