ylum sunday-school say it over once'),(21833,5,295,1502,'but i didnt like it then'),(21834,5,258,282456,'he had such a cracked voice and he prayed it so mournfully'),(21835,5,279,12680,'i really felt sure he thought praying was a disagreeable duty'),(21836,5,37,297,'this isnt poetry but it makes me feel just the same way poetry does'),(21837,5,2043,5031,'our father who art in heaven hallowed be thy name'),(21838,5,163,16036,'that is just like a line of music'),(21839,5,5037,351528,'oh im so glad you thought of making me learn this miss--marilla'),(21840,5,43,33186,'well learn it and hold your tongue said marilla shortly'),(21841,5,30104,16111,'anne tipped the vase of apple blossoms near enough to bestow a soft kiss on a pink-cupped bud and then studied diligently for some moments longer'),(21842,5,333265,333528,'marilla she demanded presently do you think that i shall ever have a bosom friend in avonlea'),(21843,5,352400,1343,'a--a what kind of friend'),(21844,5,23,28464,'a bosom friend--an intimate friend you know--a really kindred spirit to whom i can confide my inmost soul'),(21845,5,226572,534,'ive dreamed of meeting her all my life'),(21846,5,279,813,'i never really supposed i would but so many of my loveliest dreams have come true all at once that perhaps this one will too'),(21847,5,513,346,'do you think its possible'),(21848,5,4247,3942,'diana barry lives over at orchard slope and shes about your age'),(21849,5,336762,8866,'shes a very nice little girl and perhaps she will be a playmate for you when she comes home'),(21850,5,336762,2530,'shes visiting her aunt over at carmody just now'),(21851,5,104155,384,'youll have to be careful how you behave yourself though'),(21852,5,340351,1506,'barry is a very particular woman'),(21853,5,729,676,'she wont let diana play with any little girl who isnt nice and good'),(21854,5,30104,198,'anne looked at marilla through the apple blossoms her eyes aglow with interest'),(21855,5,994,591,'what is diana like'),(21856,5,382,6