 through with her ohs anne cast herself into marillas arms and rapturously kissed her sallow cheek'),(22651,5,67,11135,'it was the first time in her whole life that childish lips had voluntarily touched marillas face'),(22652,5,3373,382,'again that sudden sensation of startling sweetness thrilled her'),(22653,5,729,5103,'she was secretly vastly pleased at annes impulsive caress which was probably the reason why she said brusquely there there never mind your kissing nonsense'),(22654,5,130931,957,'id sooner see you doing strictly as youre told'),(22655,5,42,1390,'as for cooking i mean to begin giving you lessons in that some of these days'),(22656,5,295,10508,'but youre so featherbrained anne ive been waiting to see if youd sober down a little and learn to be steady before i begin'),(22657,5,226481,140452,'youve got to keep your wits about you in cooking and not stop in the middle of things to let your thoughts rove all over creation'),(22658,5,2530,362999,'now get out your patchwork and have your square done before teatime'),(22659,5,279,53333,'i do not like patchwork said anne dolefully hunting out her workbasket and sitting down before a little heap of red and white diamonds with a sigh'),(22660,5,279,362992,'i think some kinds of sewing would be nice but theres no scope for imagination in patchwork'),(22661,5,153,28161,'its just one little seam after another and you never seem to be getting anywhere'),(22662,5,295,1347,'but of course id rather be anne of green gables sewing patchwork than anne of any other place with nothing to do but play'),(22663,5,279,384,'i wish time went as quick sewing patches as it does when im playing with diana though'),(22664,5,5037,333265,'oh we do have such elegant times marilla'),(22665,5,279,163,'i have to furnish most of the imagination but im well able to do that'),(22666,5,4247,608,'diana is simply perfect in every other way'),(22667,5,2074,636,'you know that little piece of land across the brook that runs up between our farm and