ay for giving way to temper'),(23331,5,295,1079,'but today it was different'),(23332,5,51,994,'the others who were late should have been punished as well as anne thats what'),(23333,5,1,7369,'and i dont believe in making the girls sit with the boys for punishment'),(23334,5,67,34364,'it isnt modest'),(23335,5,368158,35663,'tillie boulter was real indignant'),(23336,5,729,813,'she took annes part right through and said all the scholars did too'),(23337,5,30104,9844,'anne seems real popular among them somehow'),(23338,5,279,43,'i never thought shed take with them so well'),(23339,5,1502,32476,'then you really think id better let her stay home said marilla in amazement'),(23340,5,163,1755,'that is i wouldnt say school to her again until she said it herself'),(23341,5,5549,784,'depend upon it marilla shell cool off in a week or so and be ready enough to go back of her own accord thats what while if you were to make her go back right off dear knows what freak or tantrum shed take next and make more trouble than ever'),(23342,5,51,5810,'the less fuss made the better in my opinion'),(23343,5,729,14029,'she wont miss much by not going to school as far as that goes'),(23344,5,368456,204817,'phillips isnt any good at all as a teacher'),(23345,5,51,215561,'the order he keeps is scandalous thats what and he neglects the young fry and puts all his time on those big scholars hes getting ready for queens'),(23346,5,334224,994,'hed never have got the school for another year if his uncle hadnt been a trustee--the trustee for he just leads the other two around by the nose thats what'),(23347,5,279,40,'i declare i dont know what education in this island is coming to'),(23348,5,333253,103948,'rachel shook her head as much as to say if she were only at the head of the educational system of the province things would be much better managed'),(23349,5,333265,273,'marilla took mrs'),(23350,5,333856,873,'rachels advice and not another word was said to anne about going back to school'),(23351