 indeed marilla i do want to hear it cried anne contritely'),(26198,5,279,139,'i wont say another word--not one'),(26199,5,279,67,'i know i talk too much but i am really trying to overcome it and although i say far too much yet if you only knew how many things i want to say and dont youd give me some credit for it'),(26200,5,8565,333265,'please tell me marilla'),(26201,5,43,215561,'well miss stacy wants to organize a class among her advanced students who mean to study for the entrance examination into queens'),(26202,5,729,873,'she intends to give them extra lessons for an hour after school'),(26203,5,1,67,'and she came to ask matthew and me if we would like to have you join it'),(26204,5,994,30104,'what do you think about it yourself anne'),(26205,5,126,204817,'would you like to go to queens and pass for a teacher'),(26206,5,5037,333265,'oh marilla'),(26207,5,30104,22498,'anne straightened to her knees and clasped her hands'),(26208,5,153,6996,'its been the dream of my life--that is for the last six months ever since ruby and jane began to talk of studying for the entrance'),(26209,5,295,30188,'but i didnt say anything about it because i supposed it would be perfectly useless'),(26210,5,130931,204817,'id love to be a teacher'),(26211,5,295,133007,'but wont it be dreadfully expensive'),(26212,5,367016,378328,'andrews says it cost him one hundred and fifty dollars to put prissy through and prissy wasnt a dunce in geometry'),(26213,5,279,67,'i guess you neednt worry about that part of it'),(26214,5,483,4003,'when matthew and i took you to bring up we resolved we would do the best we could for you and give you a good education'),(26215,5,279,55,'i believe in a girl being fitted to earn her own living whether she ever has to or not'),(26216,5,104155,24201,'youll always have a home at green gables as long as matthew and i are here but nobody knows what is going to happen in this uncertain world and its just as well to be prepared'),(26217,5,1051,30104,'so you can join th